{"id":133308,"title":"DevFest Amman 2026","audience_type":"IN_PERSON","speaker":null,"speaker_twitter":null,"company":null,"company_twitter":null,"description_short":"GDG Amman hosts DevFest 2026 in November, spotlighting AI, Cloud, Mobile, and Web innovations. This conference offers diverse activities, workshops, and networking, focusing on thriving in the Agentic Era. Ideal for developers enhancing workflows with AI, AI builders scaling apps, or enthusiasts exploring AI realities, it's a must-attend for optimizing and innovating with Google's technologies.","show_short_description_on_event_banner":false,"description":"<h2>Registration starts on Nov 1st, 2026.</h2><h3>GDG Amman is bringing DevFest right to Amman in November 2026, featuring a wide range of the latest technology advancements and focusing on AI, Cloud, Mobile, Web, and more. </h3><p>DevFest is the GDG program's annual globally distributed conference. Different from a meetup or speaker session, DevFest events cover multiple topics and offer a suite of activities, hands-on workshops, and networking opportunities that aim to help local developers and AI builders come together to learn, build, and understand Google's and open-source development technologies. For the DevFest 2026 theme, we are focusing on thriving in the Agentic Era and building safe, secure, and scalable applications with the Google stack. Whether you are a professional developer elevating your engineering workflow with AI agents, an AI builder going from vibe coding your first app to making it ready to scale, or a tech enthusiast looking to understand the reality behind the AI hype through live Gemini demos, this year's theme empowers everyone to optimize, augment, and innovate across AI, Cloud, Mobile, and Web.</p><p></p><h2>Agenda (More to Come!)</h2><h2></h2>","picture":{},"tickets":[{"id":83954,"event":133308,"title":"Super Early Bird","audience_type":"IN_PERSON","description":"You are the earliest to know about DevFest 2026! Exclusi